      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "In this handbook, the terms ‘generic product,’ ‘product,’ or ‘product information’ pertain to the general identifying details of a health product, excluding any manufacturer-specific information."
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "Handbook wording, quoted. A candidate: not adopted, nothing chosen between alternatives. Alternative wording in Ch 2 (page 28): 'Generic products can be described as generic items that conceal the brand or manufacturer information.' Countries identify them with generic national product codes.",
