      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Classifications such as the anatomical therapeutic chemical classification system with defined daily doses (ATC/DDD) and the international statistical classification of diseases (ICD) categorize diseases, pathogens, or health products to assist with morbidity and mortality statistics and support healthcare decision-making."
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "Handbook wording, quoted. A candidate: not adopted, nothing chosen between alternatives. Defined by example. Fig 8 places it above Generic Product and Trade Item (strategic, tactical, operational use).",
